{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a precise structured data extraction assistant for JSON output. Copy values exactly from the source text. Do not omit explicitly stated person names.\n\n## Task\n\nExtract one user profile from the text as JSON. Always fill name, age, location, roles, and hobbies when the source text provides them. Use the exact person name from the text.\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"UserDetail\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"age\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"default\": 0\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"location\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"roles\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"x-title\": \"item\",\n                \"description\": \"Correctly extract items of type: UserRole\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                    \"id\": {\n                        \"type\": \"integer\",\n                        \"description\": \"Monotonically increasing identifier\"\n                    },\n                    \"title\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"default\": \"\"\n                    }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                    \"id\"\n                ],\n                \"x-php-class\": \"\\\\UserRole\",\n                \"additionalProperties\": false\n            },\n            \"default\": []\n        },\n        \"hobbies\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Correctly extract items of type: string\"\n            },\n            \"default\": []\n        }\n    },\n    \"x-php-class\": \"UserDetail\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"Jason is 25 years old, he is an engineer and tech lead. He lives in\nSan Francisco. He likes to play soccer and climb mountains."}],"stream":true,"max_completion_tokens":1024,"stream_options":{"include_usage":true},"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}}